{
  "_comment": "The Rad that ./dev is written in. Unlike the other two pins, ./dev cannot fetch this one - it is already running under it by the time it could look - so this file is read by CI, which installs exactly this build before taking the gate, and by anyone reproducing that. A contributor's own rad is free to be any version: a rad too old to parse ./dev fails at the first line it cannot read, and says which. Checksums are upstream's, copied from the release's checksums.txt.",
